! Negation diagnostic

# Translate “I didn't eat” using 没 (méi).
# Translate “Do you study Chinese?” with the question particle 吗 (ma).
# Explain why 不 (bù) and 没 (méi) are not merely a present/past pair.

<details><summary>Show model answers</summary>

# 我没吃饭。 — Wǒ méi chī fàn.
# 你学中文吗？ — Nǐ xué Zhōngwén ma?
# 不 frequently negates a habit, disposition, or prediction; 没 denies the occurrence of an event or possession/existence in 没有.

</details>

